[28.505,"o","Goal/acceptance: `app.js`’s exported `add(a, b)` returns the sum; a regression test passes.\r\n1. In `app.js`, change `add()` from `return a - b;` to `return a + b;`, preserving the CommonJS export.\r\n2. Create `app.test.js` using `node:test` and `node:assert/strict`; import `add` via `require('./app')` and assert `add(2, 3) === 5`.\r\n3. Verify with `node --test app.test.js`; confirm the test fails against the original subtraction.\r\nRisk/open question: No package manifest or test setup exists; confirm Node supports `node:test`.\r\n\r\n---\r\njob_id: job-261022182741-042a\r\nsession_id: 01a164de-7990-76d3-bd87-ba22f1b9a31b (pass as session_id to continue this Codex thread)\r\nmodel: codex default, effort: low\r\n"]
